Now, katex will be downloaded for every diagram, which will slow down our load time.

Can you move the import into this if block? Also, you'll have to check if the text has the katexRegex present before doing the import, so we only download katex if a diagram has katex.

```ts
if( <mathMLCheck> && <textHasKatex> ) {
  const katex = await import('katex');
  // rest
}
```

```suggestion
  if (hasKatex(text) && (isMathMLSupported() || config.legacyMathML)) {
```
